# 🚀 Laxa - Advanced AI Coding Assistant

Laxa is a next-generation AI-powered coding tool that goes beyond Replit, offering advanced features for developers to write, execute, and collaborate on code seamlessly.

## ✨ Key Features

- **Advanced Code Editor** - Syntax highlighting, themes, multi-tab support
- **AI-Powered Assistance** - Context-aware code suggestions and completions
- **Multi-Language Support** - Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Java, C++, Go, Rust, and more
- **Real-time Code Execution** - Run code instantly in isolated environments
- **Smart Debugging** - AI-assisted debugging with error analysis
- **Version Control Integration** - Git integration for version management
- **Collaboration Features** - Real-time multiplayer coding
- **Advanced Terminal** - Built-in terminal with command execution
- **Template Library** - Pre-built project templates
- **API Integration** - Connect with external APIs and services

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend**: React, TypeScript, Vite, TailwindCSS, Monaco Editor
- **Backend**: Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL
- **AI**: OpenAI API, LLM Integration
- **Execution**: Docker, Sandbox Environment
- **Real-time**: Socket.io for collaboration
- **DevOps**: Docker, GitHub Actions

## 🚀 Getting Started

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/sahanivikash8090-bit/laxa.git
cd laxa

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Setup environment variables
cp .env.example .env

# Start with Docker
docker-compose up -d

# Start development server
npm run dev
